v13.0.0 +
  * Update ALTCHA widget to v3 (3.2.3, bundle with all translations) and altcha-org/altcha to ^2.1
  * Replace maxNumber by minimumComplexity / maximumComplexity (PBKDF2 cost, randomized per challenge)
  * Labels now default to the translations shipped with the widget; TypoScript labels are optional overrides
  * Fix default validation type (onload instead of load)

v12.0.0 +
  * Drop support for TYPO3 v10 and v11
  * Removal of the Altcha library from our source; installation is now done exclusively via Composer.
  * Updating the Altcha dependency

v10.0.5 +
  * adds support for TYPO3 encryption key, uses $GLOBALS['TYPO3_CONF_VARS']['SYS']['encryptionKey'] if no hmac is set in setup

v10.0.4 +
  * adds Content Security Policy configuration for fixing issues with chrome browser

v10.0.3 +
  * Bugfix & Merge Request for hiding altcha logo and header

v10.0.2 +
  * reduces field size for field 'challenge' from 1024 to 256 byte

v10.0.1 +
  * Consideration of an additional create action in the spam shield class

v10.0.0 +
  * initial commit
